{
  "title": "Storage Gateway · SAA-C03 개념 위키",
  "description": "사내 애플리케이션의 파일·볼륨·테이프 환경을 AWS 저장소와 연결합니다.",
  "main": "<nav aria-label=\"현재 위치\" class=\"breadcrumb\"><a href=\"/concepts/\">개념 위키</a><span aria-hidden=\"true\">/</span><span>Storage Gateway</span></nav><div class=\"wiki-layout\"><aside class=\"wiki-toc\"><details open=\"\"><summary>이 문서의 목차</summary><nav aria-label=\"문서 목차\"><ol><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/gateway/#overview\">개요</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/gateway/#guide-1\">기존 저장 방식에 맞는 게이트웨이</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/gateway/#guide-2\">로컬 환경과 클라우드 연결</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/gateway/#visual\">구성 한눈에 보기</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/gateway/#scenario\">적용 예시</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/gateway/#references\">AWS 공식 문서</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/gateway/#practice\">연관 문제 5개</a></li></ol></nav></details><a class=\"back-index\" href=\"/concepts/\">← 전체 개념 보기</a></aside><div class=\"wiki-main\"><article class=\"term-article\"><header class=\"article-header\"><div class=\"term-meta\"><span>스토리지</span><span>53 / 62</span></div><h1>Storage Gateway</h1></header><section class=\"overview\" id=\"overview\"><h2>개요</h2><p>Storage Gateway는 <strong>사내에서 사용하는 저장 방식과 AWS 스토리지를 연결하는 하이브리드 서비스</strong>입니다. 기존 애플리케이션의 파일 공유나 백업 방식을 유지하면서 데이터를 클라우드에 보관할 때 사용합니다.</p><p>사내에 배치한 게이트웨이가 로컬 접근과 클라우드 저장 사이를 연결합니다. 자주 사용하는 데이터는 로컬 캐시로 처리해 접근 지연을 줄일 수 있습니다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section concept-guide\" id=\"guide-1\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"concept-anchor\" id=\"comparison\"></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"concept-anchor\" id=\"s3-file-gateway\"></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"concept-anchor\" id=\"local-cache-and-upload-buffer\"></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"concept-anchor\" id=\"cached-volumes\"></span><h2>기존 저장 방식에 맞는 게이트웨이</h2><p><strong>S3 File Gateway</strong>는 NFS 또는 SMB 파일 공유를 제공하고 파일을 S3 객체로 저장합니다. 파일 기반 애플리케이션을 S3 저장소와 연결할 때 사용합니다.</p><p><strong>Volume Gateway</strong>는 블록 볼륨을 제공하고, <strong>Tape Gateway</strong>는 기존 백업 프로그램이 사용할 가상 테이프 환경을 제공합니다. 애플리케이션의 인터페이스에 맞춰 유형을 선택합니다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section concept-guide\" id=\"guide-2\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"concept-anchor\" id=\"stored-volumes\"></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"concept-anchor\" id=\"tape-gateway\"></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"concept-anchor\" id=\"fsx-file-gateway\"></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"concept-anchor\" id=\"deployment-and-security\"></span><h2>로컬 환경과 클라우드 연결</h2><p>게이트웨이를 실행할 환경, 로컬 캐시 용량, AWS와의 네트워크 연결을 준비합니다. 데이터가 업로드되는 속도와 통신 장애 시의 동작도 고려합니다.</p><p>File Gateway의 공유 파일을 S3에서 직접 변경하는 경우에는 캐시와 파일 목록의 반영 방식을 확인합니다. 데이터 이동만 필요하다면 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/migration/\">DataSync</a>와 역할을 비교합니다.</p></section><section class=\"visual\" id=\"visual\"><figure class=\"diagram concept-diagram\"><figcaption><b>사내 파일을 AWS에 보관</b></figcaption><div class=\"diagram-body\"><ol class=\"concept-flow\"><li><strong>사내 애플리케이션</strong><span>파일 공유로 접근</span></li><li><strong>File Gateway</strong><span>로컬 캐시·프로토콜 연결</span></li><li><strong>Amazon S3</strong><span>객체로 데이터 저장</span></li></ol><p class=\"diagram-note\">기존 파일 접근 방식을 클라우드 저장소와 연결하는 구성의 예시입니다.</p></div></figure></section><section class=\"scenario\" id=\"scenario\"><h2>적용 예시</h2><p>사내 업무 프로그램은 SMB 공유 폴더에 문서를 저장합니다. S3 File Gateway를 연결해 프로그램의 파일 접근 방식을 유지하면서 문서를 S3에 보관합니다.</p></section><section class=\"references\" id=\"references\"><h2>AWS 공식 문서</h2><ol><li id=\"reference-1\"><a href=\"https://docs.aws.amazon.com/filegateway/latest/files3/what-is-file-s3.html\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">What is Amazon S3 File Gateway ↗</a></li><li id=\"reference-2\"><a href=\"https://docs.aws.amazon.com/storagegateway/latest/vgw/WhatIsStorageGateway.html\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">What is Volume Gateway? ↗</a></li><li id=\"reference-3\"><a href=\"https://docs.aws.amazon.com/storagegateway/latest/tgw/WhatIsStorageGateway.html\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">What is Tape Gateway? ↗</a></li><li id=\"reference-4\"><a href=\"https://docs.aws.amazon.com/filegateway/latest/filefsxw/DocumentHistory.html\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Document history for the Amazon FSx File Gateway User Guide ↗</a></li><li id=\"reference-5\"><a href=\"https://docs.aws.amazon.com/storagegateway/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">AWS Storage Gateway 설명서 ↗</a></li></ol></section></article><section class=\"related-questions\" id=\"practice\"><div class=\"section-heading\"><div><p class=\"eyebrow\">PRACTICE · ENGLISH</p><h2>연관 문제 5개</h2></div><a href=\"/concepts/quiz/q049/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><article class=\"question-card\" data-correct=\"2\" data-question=\"Q049\" data-revision=\"1\" id=\"question-Q049\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q049</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q049/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">An on-premises application expects an SMB file share, while new files must be stored as objects in S3. Which service is appropriate?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q049\" type=\"radio\" value=\"0\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">Amazon Route 53</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q049\" type=\"radio\" value=\"1\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">An RDS read replica</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q049\" type=\"radio\" value=\"2\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">S3 File Gateway</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q049\" type=\"radio\" value=\"3\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">EBS gp3</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span aria-live=\"polite\" class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 C</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/gateway/\">File Gateway</a>가 온프레미스 파일 인터페이스와 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/s3/\">S3</a> 객체 저장을 연결한다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/gateway/\">Storage Gateway</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/s3/\">S3</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/fsx/\">FSx</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" data-correct=\"0,4\" data-question=\"Q086\" data-revision=\"1\" id=\"question-Q086\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q086</span><span class=\"type-label\">2개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q086/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">An on-premises Windows file application must retain an SMB interface while storing data in AWS. Which TWO services are candidates?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q086\" type=\"checkbox\" value=\"0\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">Amazon FSx for Windows File Server</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q086\" type=\"checkbox\" value=\"1\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">Only Amazon EFS over NFS</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q086\" type=\"checkbox\" value=\"2\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">An EBS snapshot as a file share</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q086\" type=\"checkbox\" value=\"3\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">Only Route 53 Resolver</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q086\" type=\"checkbox\" value=\"4\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">E</span><span lang=\"en\">S3 File Gateway</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span aria-live=\"polite\" class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 A, E</strong> · 관리형 Windows 파일 시스템에는 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/fsx/\">FSx</a>, <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/s3/\">S3</a> 객체로 이어지는 하이브리드 파일 인터페이스에는 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/gateway/\">File Gateway</a>가 맞는다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/fsx/\">FSx</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/gateway/\">Storage Gateway</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/types/\">Object / File / Block</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" data-correct=\"3\" data-question=\"Q050\" data-revision=\"1\" id=\"question-Q050\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q050</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q050/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">A company repeatedly transfers data from an on-premises NAS to EFS and S3 over the network and synchronizes changes. Which service should it use?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q050\" type=\"radio\" value=\"0\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">An Elastic IP address</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q050\" type=\"radio\" value=\"1\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">AWS Snow Family only</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q050\" type=\"radio\" value=\"2\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">AWS CloudTrail</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q050\" type=\"radio\" value=\"3\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">AWS DataSync</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span aria-live=\"polite\" class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 D</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/migration/#aws-datasync\">DataSync</a>는 온라인 데이터 전송·동기화를 자동화한다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/migration/\">DataSync / Snow Family</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/efs/\">EFS</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/s3/\">S3</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" data-correct=\"2\" data-question=\"Q040\" data-revision=\"1\" id=\"question-Q040\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q040</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q040/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">A web application stores image files by key and serves them over HTTP. Which service should it consider first?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q040\" type=\"radio\" value=\"0\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">A single EBS volume</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q040\" type=\"radio\" value=\"1\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">An ENI</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q040\" type=\"radio\" value=\"2\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">Amazon S3</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q040\" type=\"radio\" value=\"3\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">A network ACL</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span aria-live=\"polite\" class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 C</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/s3/\">S3</a>는 객체 저장과 API <span class=\"full-name\">(Application Programming Interface)</span> 접근에 적합하다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/s3/\">S3</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/types/\">Object / File / Block</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" data-correct=\"2\" data-question=\"Q047\" data-revision=\"1\" id=\"question-Q047\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q047</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q047/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">Linux EC2 instances in multiple AZs must share the same files through a POSIX/NFS interface. Which service should be considered?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q047\" type=\"radio\" value=\"0\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">S3 Glacier Deep Archive</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q047\" type=\"radio\" value=\"1\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">Each instance's local instance store</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q047\" type=\"radio\" value=\"2\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">Regional Amazon EFS</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q047\" type=\"radio\" value=\"3\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">One EBS volume directly attached across AZs</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span aria-live=\"polite\" class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 C</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/region/\">리전</a>형 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/efs/\">EFS</a>는 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/az/\">AZ</a>별 마운트 대상을 통해 여러 Linux 자원에서 공유할 수 있다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/efs/\">EFS</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/types/\">Object / File / Block</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/az/\">AZ</a></div></article></section><nav aria-label=\"용어 이동\" class=\"sequence\"><span><a href=\"/concepts/terms/step/\">이전 용어 <b>Step Functions</b></a></span><span><a href=\"/concepts/terms/sts/\">다음 용어 <b>STS / SCP</b></a></span></nav></div></div>"
}
